note Shared constants and struct declarations for the pure seeded OM-2 estimation stack
note (EST-0 types, EST-1 KF, EST-1 info ref, EST-3b scale mixture, EST-2/v3 discrete
note predictive layer, and EST-v4 persistence-aware families).
note Must be first in any concatenated omc build so om2 and all structs precede the first fn.
om2

